  "solution": "Mẫu số liệu trên có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>11</mn></semantics></math> giá trị và đã sắp thứ tự không giảm.<br>Khi đó <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>6</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>31</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Khi đó <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></semantics></math> bằng trung vị của dãy <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mspace width=\"2.0em\"/><mn>2</mn><mspace width=\"2.0em\"/><mn>28</mn><mspace width=\"2.0em\"/><mn>30</mn><mspace width=\"2.0em\"/><mn>31</mn></mrow></semantics></math> (có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>5</mn></semantics></math> giá trị) nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>28</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Khi đó <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></semantics></math> bằng trung vị của dãy <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>32</mn><mspace width=\"2.0em\"/><mn>33</mn><mspace width=\"2.0em\"/><mn>34</mn><mspace width=\"2.0em\"/><mn>42</mn><mspace width=\"2.0em\"/><mn>44</mn></mrow></semantics></math> (có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>5</mn></semantics></math> giá trị) nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>34</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Khoảng biến thiên của mẫu số liệu trên là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>34</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>28</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msub><mi>Δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>28</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>19</mn></mrow></semantics></math>; \t  <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msub><mi>Δ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>34</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>43</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Khi đó các giá trị ngoại lệ trong mẫu số liệu trên là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>1</mn></semantics></math>; <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>2</mn></semantics></math>; <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>44</mn></semantics></math>.",
